                    {
                        "sense_id": "a0efca4a-33c7-3962-bd7b-4e2b17381a47",
                        "entry_id": "74ee6cba-7df3-315e-9afa-9320b4359701",
                        "glosses": [
                            "First, earliest or original."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6d3e2345-7519-4d11-b82d-9c7865490f65",
                                "sense_id": "a0efca4a-33c7-3962-bd7b-4e2b17381a47",
                                "text": "the primordial facts of our intelligent nature"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f6d0a7bc-e6d3-44fe-b745-b28a0496cd76",
                                "sense_id": "a0efca4a-33c7-3962-bd7b-4e2b17381a47",
                                "text": "As an archetypal image of primordial unity, the cosmic egg suggests that there is unity and fragmentation, eternity and time."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "aaaf689c-7db6-35b7-9642-ed7df210b534",
                        "entry_id": "74ee6cba-7df3-315e-9afa-9320b4359701",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Characteristic of the earliest stage of the development of an organism, or relating to a primordium."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "891276bf-7fe1-42e2-a6e5-3f1ecf69d449",
                                "sense_id": "aaaf689c-7db6-35b7-9642-ed7df210b534",
                                "text": "a primordial leaf; a primordial cell"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ce37e3a3-836e-3e24-957f-477fb213a379",
                        "entry_id": "74ee6cba-7df3-315e-9afa-9320b4359701",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Primeval."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "70bb2296-5573-3d04-b2fc-da8feea88f5f",
                        "entry_id": "74ee6cba-7df3-315e-9afa-9320b4359701",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Of an element or isotope: occurring primordially (on Earth) (i.e. inherited from when the Earth was formed); because it is stable, or radioactive but so long-lived that some is left over from when the Earth was formed. For example, primordial radioisotopes (T = half-life in years) include uranium-235 (T = 7×10⁸), potassium-40 (T = 1.25×10⁹), uranium-238 (T = 4.5×10⁹), and thorium-232 (T = 1.4×10¹⁰)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "85c0fc0b-2482-43c1-a04c-03816305c92e",
                        "source_entry_id": "74ee6cba-7df3-315e-9afa-9320b4359701",
                        "source_sense_description": "earliest",
                        "target_lang_word": "oorspronkelijk",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "oorspronkelijk",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "96fa1f9d-a05e-341e-9292-1cd21a83cd16",
                                        "entry_id": "59020a4b-438c-315f-85fd-a73c417019b0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "zoals het in begin was"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a4caf46f-2235-4c2d-a6c2-d27fa6d9eeeb",
                                                "sense_id": "96fa1f9d-a05e-341e-9292-1cd21a83cd16",
                                                "text": "Dit is de oorspronkelijk vorm van dit woord."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c5a9c2a3-be9d-4255-ad45-b7895af90535",
                                                "sense_id": "96fa1f9d-a05e-341e-9292-1cd21a83cd16",
                                                "text": "Omdat de gemeente bij de bouw nu afwijkt van het oorspronkelijke bouwplan, vindt Struis dat hij zich niet meer aan deze vaststellingsovereenkomst hoeft te houden."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "93ae13cd-a598-4561-8383-2fc5102f5c07",
                                                "sense_id": "96fa1f9d-a05e-341e-9292-1cd21a83cd16",
                                                "text": "Dank aan de auteurs en uitgevers die overname toestonden (zie voor bijzonderheden 'Bronnen' aan het einde van het boek). De oorspronkelijke spelling hiervan is zoveel mogelijk gehandhaafd. Van enkele stukken bleken, tot onze spijt, auteur en uitgever niet te achterhalen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eebdcf3f-048c-4be9-b5e4-189f5b7d1554",
                                                "sense_id": "96fa1f9d-a05e-341e-9292-1cd21a83cd16",
                                                "text": "Of Ingenuity het tot die tijd overleeft, is nog de vraag. De helikopter gaat al veel langer mee dan oorspronkelijk de bedoeling was. NASA ging ervan uit dat de helikopter vijf vluchten zou maken. Inmiddels heeft het apparaat 28 vluchten afgerond en 6,8 kilometer afgelegd."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
